      "id": "b-00-overview-future-targets-such-as-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Future targets, such as GitHub, S3, webhooks, or another remote store, are not implemented today. If they are added later, they should plug in after folder export without changing the source reading or canonical data shape."
        }
